2026-11-24  Roman Senn  <roman.l.senn@gmail.com>

	Helper pair js-utils.[ch], adopted from qjs-sound and qjs-nanovg.

	* js-utils.h, js-utils.c:
	New. js_class_register, js_object_from_target, js_typedarray_kind
	(exact kind by class id), js_typedarray_get and js_typedarray_expect
	(bytes without copy), js_typedarray_external (view over native
	memory, free callback runs exactly once), js_typedarray_copy,
	js_array_toint64, js_array_length, js_global_get_str. Element kinds
	are the JSTypedArrayEnum of quickjs.h. Self-tested under ASan and
	UBSan: kinds, offsets, zero length, bad dims, external memory
	lifetime, subclass prototypes.

	* CMakeLists.txt:
	Build js-utils.c into module ort.

	* TODO.md:
	The tasks use the helpers instead of hand-rolled code. QuickJS facts
	found by the self-test: JS_NewTypedArray with one argument gives a
	length 0 array for an ArrayBuffer, JS_GetTypedArrayBuffer rejects a
	DataView.

2026-11-24  Roman Senn  <roman.l.senn@gmail.com>

	C style rules recorded.

	* CLAUDE.md (C style):
	New section, written as general rules without code examples. All
	variables are declared at the beginning of their block scope, an
	assignment used only for a test is folded into the test, and an
	empty line follows the closing brace of an inner block.

2026-11-24  Roman Senn  <roman.l.senn@gmail.com>

	Tensor class, float32 only (PoC task 1), written by the nemotron
	harness session and reviewed.

	* quickjs-ort.c (js_ort_init_api, js_ort_throw_status,
	js_ort_tensor_ctor, js_ort_tensor_finalizer, js_ort_tensor_gc_mark,
	js_ort_tensor_get_type, js_ort_tensor_get_dims,
	js_ort_tensor_get_data, js_ort_tensor_wrap, js_ort_init):
	New. Tensor(type, data, dims) over a Float32Array without copying,
	getters type, dims and data, Symbol.toStringTag, subclassable. ORT
	errors become Error objects with the ORT message and a code. The
	data getter of an output tensor is still undefined (task 3).

	* tests/tensor-test.js:
	New. Constructor, getters, bad type, bad dims, zero dims, subclass,
	scalar.

	* TODO.md:
	Task 1 deleted.

2026-11-24  Roman Senn  <roman.l.senn@gmail.com>

	Session class, minimal (PoC task 2), written by the nemotron harness
	session and reviewed.

	* quickjs-ort.c (js_ort_session_ctor, js_ort_session_finalizer,
	js_ort_session_free_names, js_ort_session_get_input_names,
	js_ort_session_get_output_names,
	js_ort_session_release, js_ort_init):
	New. Session(path) on the CPU provider with default options,
	inputNames and outputNames, release(), Symbol.toStringTag. The names
	are copied into QuickJS memory and the ORT originals freed at once.
	Every failure path releases the session, the options and the names
	collected so far, and the path string is freed once. Function
	definitions of the file now follow the C style rule of one line for
	the return type.

	* tests/session-test.js:
	New. Loads u2netp.onnx, prints the names (input.1, outputs 1959 to
	1965), missing file gives code 3, a text file gives code 7, release
	twice, bad arguments, names after release.

	* TODO.md:
	Task 2 deleted, the u2netp names recorded.

2026-11-24  Roman Senn  <roman.l.senn@gmail.com>

	All C sources reformatted to the C style rules.

	* quickjs-ort.c, js-utils.c:
	Declarations at the top of every block with an empty line after
	them, a call that is only tested by the next statement moved into
	the test, an empty line after the closing brace of inner blocks,
	return type on its own line. No change of behaviour: both tests
	and the helper self-test pass.

	* js-utils.h:
	Comments follow the comment style (lowercase start), the history
	line about the origin of the helpers is gone.

	* CLAUDE.md (C style):
	An empty line separates declarations from the first statement, and
	a declaration whose initialiser is only tested next is split.

2026-11-24  Roman Senn  <roman.l.senn@gmail.com>

	clangd finds the compile flags of this project.

	* CMakeLists.txt:
	Set CMAKE_EXPORT_COMPILE_COMMANDS, so build/compile_commands.json
	has the include paths of QuickJS and ONNX Runtime.

	* .clangd:
	New. Points clangd at build/. The .clangd of the parent quickjs
	directory pins the top-level build database, which does not contain
	this project, so clangd borrowed flags from another file and did not
	find onnxruntime_c_api.h.

2026-11-24  Roman Senn  <roman.l.senn@gmail.com>

	session.run() and the data of output tensors (PoC task 3), first
	version from the nemotron harness session, run() rewritten after
	review.

	* quickjs-ort.c (js_ort_session_run):
	New. run(feeds, outputNames?) maps input names to Tensor objects,
	calls ORT Run and returns an object of output tensors. Unknown or
	missing inputs, a non-Tensor input, bad outputNames and a released
	session throw. One cleanup label frees the name and value arrays,
	the property table and every output value that was not wrapped yet.
	The first version leaked its arrays on every error path and printed
	names after freeing them.

	* quickjs-ort.c (js_ort_tensor_wrap):
	The value is released on every failure path, as the contract says.

	* quickjs-ort.c (js_ort_tensor_get_data, js_ort_view_free):
	The data of an output tensor is a new Float32Array view over the ORT
	memory, no copy, with a reference to the tensor that keeps it valid.

	* tests/run-test.js:
	New. u2netp run with a zero input, output keys, dims and value range,
	outputNames subset, a view that outlives its tensor, and the error
	cases. 12 rounds of success and error runs leave the memory counts
	and the resident size unchanged.

	* TODO.md:
	Task 3 deleted.

